WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
In your library, choose Edit game

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Open your saved game

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Find your private notes

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.200
Write your review

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.200
These notes stay private until you publish them

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.000
Select Publish these notes as a public review

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.500
A rating is required to publish

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.700
Save your changes

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.000
Open the game page

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.800
Go to Player reviews

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.800
Your review now appears in Player reviews
